url: "https://github.com/hf8bz/C2GRAPH"

license: MIT

abstract: >-
  C2GRAPH is a repository-level governance framework for AI coding agents.
  It externalizes operational constraints such as goal state, evidence,
  write authority, rollback scope, context budget, handoff, provenance,
  tool discipline, failure memory, and verification into persistent
  repository-level control structures.

